#: _translatorinfo.cpp:1
msgid ""
"_: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your names"
msgstr "Owain Green ar gyfer KGyfieithu - Meddalwedd Gymraeg"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
"_: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your emails"
msgstr "kyfieithu@dotmon.com"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Socks"
msgstr "Socks"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Enable SOCKS support"
msgstr "&Galluogi cynhaliaeth SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Check this to enable SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 support in KDE applications and I/O "
"subsystems."
msgstr ""
"Brithwch hwn i alluogi cynhaliaeth SOCKS4 a SOCKS5 mewn cymhwysiadau KDE ac "
"is-gysawdau M/A."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "SOCKS Implementation"
msgstr "Gweithredoliant SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "A&uto detect"
msgstr "Canfod &ymysgogol"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If you select Autodetect, then KDE will automatically search for an "
"implementation of SOCKS on your computer."
msgstr ""
"Os dewiswch Canfod ymysgogol, bydd KDE'n chwilio'n ymysgogol am weithredoliant "
"SOCKS ar eich cyfrifiadur."

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&NEC SOCKS"
msgstr "SOCKS &NEC"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This will force KDE to use NEC SOCKS if it can be found."
msgstr "Gorfoda hyn i KDE ddefnyddio SOCKS NEC os gellir ei ganfod."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Use &custom library"
msgstr "Defnyddio rhaglengell &addasiedig"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Select custom if you wish to use an unlisted SOCKS library. Please note that "
"this may not always work as it depends on the API of the library which you "
"specify (below)."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch addasiedig os ydych am ddefnyddio rhaglengell SOCKS sydd ddim yn y "
"restr. Noder efallai na fydd hyn yn gweithio bob tro gan ei fod yn dibynnu ar "
"API'r rhaglengell y penodwch (isod)."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "&Path:"
msgstr "&Llwybr:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Enter the path to an unsupported SOCKS library."
msgstr "Rhowch y llwybr i raglengell SOCKS heb gynhaliaeth."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "&Dante"
msgstr "&Dante"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "This will force KDE to use Dante if it can be found."
msgstr "Gorfoda hyn i KDE ddefnyddio Dante os gellir ei ganfod."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Additional Library Search Paths"
msgstr "Llwybrau Chwilio Rhaglengelloedd Ychwanegol"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"Here you can specify additional directories to search for the SOCKS libraries. "
"/usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib and /opt/socks5/lib are already "
"searched by default."
msgstr ""
"Yma gallwch benodi cyfeiriaduron ychwanegol i'w chwilio am y rhaglengelloedd "
"SOCKS. Chwilir /usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib, ac "
"/opt/socks5/lib yn ymysgogol yn barod."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Llwybr"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "This is the list of additional paths that will be searched."
msgstr "Dyma restr y llwybrau ychwanegol y chwilir."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "&Ychwanegu"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Profi"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Click here to test SOCKS support."
msgstr "Cliciwch yma i brofi cynhaliaeth SOCKS."

#: socks.cpp:88
msgid "These changes will only apply to newly started applications."
msgstr "Gweithreda'r newidiadau yma ar gymhwysiadau newydd eu cychwyn yn unig."

#: socks.cpp:90 socks.cpp:123 socks.cpp:128
msgid "SOCKS Support"
msgstr "Cynhaliaeth SOCKS"

#: socks.cpp:122
msgid "Success! SOCKS was found and initialized."
msgstr "Llwyddiant! Canfuwyd SOCKS ac fe'u ymgychwynwyd."

#: socks.cpp:127
msgid "SOCKS could not be loaded."
msgstr "Nid oedd modd llwytho SOCKS."

#: socks.cpp:266
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>Galluoga'r modwl yma i chi ffurfweddu cynhaliaeth KDE am weinydd neu "
"ddirprwy SOCKS.</p>"
"<p>Protocol yw SOCKS i groes muriau cadarn, disgrifir yn <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>Os nad oes gennych syniad beth yw hwn ac os nad yw'ch rheolwr cysawd wedi "
"dweud wrthych am ei ddefnyddio, gadewch yn analluog.</p>"

#: socks.cpp:277
msgid "kcmsocks"
msgstr "kcmsocks"

#: socks.cpp:277
msgid "KDE SOCKS Control Module"
msgstr "Modwl Rheoli SOCKS KDE"

